   403	- The orchestrator delegated implementation to `/root/field_removal_developer` using the configured Developer role (`gpt-6.2-sol` / `low`). The prompt authorized edits only to seeds, startup cleanup, relevant tests and field-specific examples, required safe idempotent preservation of databases/volumes/editorial content, asked for regression coverage of draft and published CO/CL catalogs, and prohibited Git mutations. The Developer used TDD and reported a failing fresh-catalog assertion before the fix. It removed the field from both seeds and added a transaction-scoped startup migration that removes only the retired component from CO/CL form versions without republishing drafts. Regression fixtures cover divergent draft and published content in both countries and retain generic checkbox and dynamic reconciliation coverage.
