+- Prior QA, review and database-verification limitations remain in their original records. This addendum records that the three formerly failing cases now pass in the two tested catalog states; it does not imply reviewer-executed browser tests or non-Chromium/screen-reader verification. Final human approval is pending. No files were staged, committed or pushed; no branches, databases or volumes were deleted.
