+- The project owner explicitly approved the scoped browser failure correction with the message “approve.” Recorded the decision in [the final approval](docs/approvals/US-01-US-02-browser-failure-correction-final-approval.md). This closes the correction after Developer implementation, independent QA and independent Review.
